WEBVIEW_PLAN.md phase W4:
- wv_paint.{h,c}: clip-aware rect/glyph/text; PSF2 VGA 8x16 font
  embedded as data (same blob as the kernel console); synthesised bold
  (double-strike, D7); underline; display-list runs cull anything fully
  outside the viewport
